        "original_id": "ebc19cde-d598-5fef-85d1-44bc11f8805f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brigitte Kuhlmann\n- Organizations: Revolutionäre Zellen, Israel Defense Forces\n- Events: Operation Entebbe\n- Places: Entebbe, Uganda, Entebbe Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann was born in 1947.\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann was a founding member of Revolutionäre Zellen, a West German left-wing militant group often considered a terrorist group.\n- On 4 July 1976, the Israel Defense Forces carried out Operation Entebbe, a successful counter-terrorist hostage-rescue mission at Entebbe Airport in Uganda.\n- During Operation Entebbe in Entebbe, Uganda, the Israel Defense Forces killed Brigitte Kuhlmann.\n- Brigitte Kuhlmann died in 1976.",
